# Not used by the app (decision 152 — no Firebase SDK, we verify OAuth
# tokens ourselves via JWKS): this file only exists as a byproduct of
# using a Firebase project to generate Google OAuth client IDs. Kept out
# of git so it never reads as "Firebase is wired in" to a future reader.
/android/app/google-services.json
